    "en": {
      "trackName": "Hooroo: Motion-Sensing",
      "description": "Why Choose Hooroo?\nTurn your living room into a motion-sensing game hub, personal gym, and dance studio by connecting to smartwatches like Apple Watch!\nFeatured in App Store's Health Recommendations | 5 Years of AI Motion Tech Expertise | Serving 1M+ Users\n\nEarly Access to Key Features\n\n\n► 100+ AI Motion-Sensing Games\nA tech-powered immersive platform blending motion capture and interactive entertainment — your body becomes the controller!\nWear & Play! Dive into 3D parkour, Fruit Ninja, Beat Saber, golf, billiards, Dance Party, Jump Challenge, darts, plane battles, and more.\n\n\n► AI-Powered Fitness Plans\nProfessional dance, boxing, and yoga programs to make workouts fun.\nPrecision Tracking: Calorie metrics rivaling gym trainers.\n20+ Scenario-Based Courses:\nFat-Burning HIIT\nOffice Stretching\nIntense Sweat Sessions\nBoxing Workouts\nReal User Results:\n\"Lose 10 lbs in 2 months with 30 mins daily!\"\n\"Family Dance — Shed weight with joy!\"\n\n\n► Little Gourd AI Assistant\n24/7 Support: Voice answers for sports injuries & nutrition Q&A",
